annable server cannot present a high one, because confidence caps the result. The scanner is open source, so this score can be reproduced independently.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How was histor scored?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Its published source was scanned against a fixed catalog of weighted security controls covering code safety, committed secrets, dependency vulnerabilities, tool-description integrity, authentication and transport, and maintenance. A confirmed flaw caps the score outright regardless of what else passes. The full rubric is published.\"}}]},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Canopii Trust Index\",\"item\":\"https://index.canopii.dev\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"MCP Servers\",\"item\":\"https://index.canopii.dev/servers\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"io.github.alexar76/histor\"}]}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"f:[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-border/70 bg-cream/85 backdrop-blur-md\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-6xl items-center gap-4 px-5 sm:px-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"shrink-0 rounded-md focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-jungle\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-heading font-semibold tracking-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/canopii-logo.png\",\"alt\":\"Canopii\",\"width\":28,\"height\":28,\"priority\":true,\"className\":\"size-7 object-contain\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg\",\"children\":[\"Canopii\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-1.5 hidden rounded-md bg-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[0.65rem] font-medium tracking-wide text-jungle uppercase sm:inline\",\"children\":\"Trust Index\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"c